  "Pip is new and all alone. Breathe along with Lumi as she finds her calm and her kind words.": "Pip es nuevo y está solito. Respira con Lumi mientras ella encuentra su calma y sus palabras amables.",
  "Today the friends were playing Parade in the Clubhouse yard. Booker banged the drum. Bop stomped. …": "Hoy los amigos jugaban al Desfile en el patio de la Casa Club. Booker tocaba el tambor. Bop pisaba fuerte. …",
  "But Lumi saw someone by the fence. It was Pip, the new little duck. Pip was not marching. Pip was not singing. …": "Pero Lumi vio a alguien junto a la cerca. Era Pip, el patito nuevo. Pip no marchaba. Pip no cantaba. …",
